Overview
Our global community of 20000 team members work towards one common goal: 
A world where more people and businesses have greater access to financial security.
We are made up of two kinds of business units:
Strategic business units (SBUs): SBU brings in revenue by selling products and providing ongoing service to external clients.
Service center business units( SCBUs):  SCBU provides services that benefit and support the entire organization: their focus is on internal customers.

